part two of reading the letter that i  wrote to my future self when i was 17.  dear 21 year old hannah i hope you're  still catholic and closer to your faith  than ever i hope you've learned to love  the way that you look and who you are i  hope that you find a man who treats you  better than you think you deserve i hope  you're a national champion by now i hope  that you look back on high school and  smile because you didn't know there was  better things ahead i hope you found  something that you're passionate about  that you want to do for the rest of your  life i hope you're still friends with  bethany bucci brooke reynolds and emily  castleto  i hope that you are the best big sister  and little sister you can be and have  have found a best friend in your  siblings i hope you believe you're as  smart as you are i hope that you stop  putting yourself down and are more  confident in who you are i hope you  don't become a [ __ ] in college i hope  you stay true to what you believe and  who you are i hope you prove everyone  wrong sincerely 17 year old hannah
 

